## REVIEWS

fashiono:Review_001
    a fashiono:Review ;
    fashiono:rating 4.8 ;
    fashiono:reviewText "Absolutely love this dress. Lightweight and perfect for summer. The linen feels very high quality." ;
    fashiono:writtenBy fashiono:Customer_Alice .

fashiono:Review_002
    a fashiono:Review ;
    fashiono:rating 4.2 ;
    fashiono:reviewText "Nice dress but runs slightly small. I would recommend sizing up." ;
    fashiono:writtenBy fashiono:Customer_Sara .

fashiono:Review_003
    a fashiono:Review ;
    fashiono:rating 4.5 ;
    fashiono:reviewText "Great basic tee. Washes well and does not shrink. Good value for the price." ;
    fashiono:writtenBy fashiono:Customer_James .

fashiono:Review_004
    a fashiono:Review ;
    fashiono:rating 5.0 ;
    fashiono:reviewText "These are proper Levis 501s. Classic fit, great denim quality. Will buy again." ;
    fashiono:writtenBy fashiono:Customer_Omar .

fashiono:Review_005
    a fashiono:Review ;
    fashiono:rating 4.6 ;
    fashiono:reviewText "Very warm and not too heavy. Wore it on a 5km run in 5 degrees and stayed comfortable." ;
    fashiono:writtenBy fashiono:Customer_James .

fashiono:Review_006
    a fashiono:Review ;
    fashiono:rating 4.0 ;
    fashiono:reviewText "Comfortable sneakers. Took a few days to break in but now they feel great." ;
    fashiono:writtenBy fashiono:Customer_Alice .

